WEBVTT

00:00:00.111 --> 00:00:05.079
This video shows how an administrator writes an official letter on a phone.

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:17.070
Tap the menu button at the top left, open HR and Staff, and choose Letter Composer. At the top are the Quick Draft Template and Line Spacing lists.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:36.076
Scroll down to the To box. Tap Employee and pick Ali Khan. The name and the employee ID fill in the To box.

00:00:45.219 --> 00:00:53.811
Choose Warning Letter in the Quick Draft Template list. The subject and the body are written for you, with the employee's name filled in.

00:01:01.662 --> 00:01:12.438
Scroll down to read the body and the preview below it. The text has a place marked REASON. Replace it with the real reason before you create the PDF.

00:01:19.865 --> 00:01:32.081
Tap Generate PDF. The letter downloads and the form clears. Scroll down to Letter History, where a new card shows the letter's subject and the person it is addressed to.

00:01:45.335 --> 00:01:51.551
The letter is saved in the history. Tap Load on a card any time to open it again.
